{"event": "model_response", "time": 1793870524.0319245, "run_id": "66b536a544974ff18502da208fc82e5f", "seq": 399, "number": 24, "response": {"id": "3da7505e-9393-4f9e-8653-9a75ccbcea3f", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1793870519, "model": "deepseek-flash", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "提交报告并运行格式测试。\n\n```python\noverview = \"综述系统梳理 agentic LLM：以自然语言为接口、能推理并自主行动以达成目标的系统，并按推理、行动、交互三类能力组织文献。推理章涵盖 CoT、Self-Consistency、Tree of Thoughts、自我改进与检索增强；行动章涵盖世界模型与机器人、工具/API 调用、代码与网页代理；交互章涵盖多智能体角色协作、社会模拟与规范涌现。作者用 Google Scholar 检索加 snowballing 扩展文献，并在展望中提出长程推理、机器人交互、科学发现、安全责任、多智能体协作与训练五个议题，强调推理与自我验证是各类能力共享的基础，行动与交互产生的新数据还能反哺预训练与微调。\"\nr = submit_report(overview, \"ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356\")\nprint(r)\nt = run_command([\"python\", \"-m\", \"pytest\", \"-q\"], \".\")\nprint(t[\"rc\"])\nprint(t[\"stdout\"][-2000:])\n```", "reasoning_content": "Let me check the current state. The progress says answers 10/10 saved, sections 5/5 saved. PDF pages missing: none. Notes for five topics appear delivered. I need to submit_report then verify with pytest and final_answer.\n\nWait—the report.json currently is {} (file hash matches initial). submit_report serializes saved results. Let me submit_report with overview and expected_hash.\n\nBut first, check whether report.json hash is current expected hash: ca3d... yes.\n\nI need an overview (200-600 chars). Then submit_report, then run pytest, then final_answer.\n\nLet me do submit_report and pytest in one action? submit_report requires expected_hash. Then run pytest. Next action final_answer.\n\nLet me draft overview in Chinese, 200-600 chars.\n\n\"综述系统梳理 agentic LLM：以自然语言为接口、能推理并自主行动以达成目标的系统，按推理、行动、交互三类能力组织文献。推理章涵盖 CoT、Self-Consistency、Tree of Thoughts、自我改进与检索增强；行动章涵盖世界模型与机器人、工具/API 调用、代码与网页代理；交互章涵盖多智能体角色协作、社会模拟与规范涌现。作者用 Google Scholar 检索加 snowballing 扩展文献，并在展望中提出长程推理、机器人交互、科学发现、安全责任与多智能体协作训练五个议题，强调推理与自我验证是所有能力共享的基础，行动与交互数据可反哺训练。\"\n\nThat's around 260 chars