EST APIs.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"toolformer_tools\",\n          \"page\": 23,\n          \"quote\": \"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"multi_agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"交互一章区分角色扮演式协作与开放社会模拟。CAMEL 用 inception prompting 让两个角色在对话中保持身份并合作完成任务；Generative Agents 模拟 25 个具有人设、记忆与反思的 agent，其可信度评估邀请人类评估者参与打分；AgentVerse 分专家招募、协作决策、行动执行与评估四阶段；AgentSociety 与 OASIS 把规模推到上万乃至百万 agent。规范研究（命名游戏、metanorm）显示局部互动可涌现全局约定，但也可能放大集体偏见。局限是规模扩大后评测成本与可复现性都变差。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 是单体的：一个模型顺序完成读、记、写，没有角色分工或评审者。已实现的是可复用的命令工具与笔记记录；不足是没有交叉校验机制。可尝试把“提取答案”和“核验引文”拆成两个角色互相批评，仍由我控制请求预算。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"camel_prompting\": \"inception_prompting\",\n        \"generative_agents_evaluators\": 100\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"camel_prompting\",\n          \"page\": 37,\n          \"quote\": \"By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"generative_agents_evaluators\",\n          \"page\": 47,\n          \"quote\": \"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"outlook\",\n      \"summary\": \"Table 4 列出五个研究议题：长程推理、机器人交互、科学发现、安全与助手的责任归属、多智能体协作与训练。结论强调三类能力并不独立：推理是基础，行动与工具使用受益于有据可依的检索增强，社会互动受益于自我反思，而所有类别都受益于推理与自我验证；行动与交互产生的新数据还能反哺预训练与微调。作者同时指出多智能体训练、安全责任划分与长程可靠性仍是开放问题。\",\n      \"application\": \"这一展望提示我把“自我验证”做进流程：我的 agent 已实现分批读页、主题笔记和结构化报告，但答案与引文的对应关系尚未自动复核。未来可在提交前加一步回读引用页并逐字比对，仍受 40 次请求与 32000 字符预算约束。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"agenda_topics\": [\n          \"training_data\",\n          \"hallucination\",\n          \"agent_behavior\",\n          \"self_reflection\",\n          \"safety\"\n        ],\n        \"shared_foundations\": [\n          \"reasoning\",\n          \"self_verification\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"question\": \"agenda_topics\",\n          \"page\": 51,\n          \"quote\": \"Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"question\": \"shared_foundations\",\n          \"page\": 52,\n          \"quote\": \"At the basis is the reasoning technology of category 1. Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n", "expected_hash": "ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356"}, "result": {"ok": true, "path": "report.json", "file_hash": "11ce8a458fe72e8257b9bc3dd312386504b578c7151670d070b49d2bd2f43d53", "before_hash": "ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356", "changed": true}}
{"event": "tool_result", "time": 1793870524.222091, "run_id": "66b536a544974ff18502da208fc82e5f", "seq": 407, "action": {"tool": "submit_report", "overview": "综述系统梳理 agentic LLM：以自然语言为接口、能推理并自主行动以达成目标的系统，并按推理、行动、交互三类能力组织文献。推理章涵盖 CoT、Self-Consistency、Tree of Thoughts、自我改进与检索增强；行动章涵盖世界模型与机器人、工具/API 调用、代码与网页代理；交互章涵盖多智能体角色协作、社会模拟与规范涌现。作者用 Google Scholar 检索加 snowballing 扩展文献，并在展望中提出长程推理、机器人交互、科学发现、安全责任、多智能体协作与训练五个议题，强调推理与自我验证是各类能力共享的基础，行动与交互产生的新数据还能反哺预训练与微调。", "expected_hash": "ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356"}, "result": {"ok": true, "path": "report.json", "file_hash": "11ce8a458fe72e8257b9bc3dd312386504b578c7151670d070b49d2bd2f43d53", "before_hash": "ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356", "changed": true}}
